### Design notes

| Decision | Reason |
|---|---|
| `Object.create(null)` | Avoids prototype pollution and collisions with keys like `"__proto__"` or `"toString"`. |
| Single pass with `forEach` | O(n) time; clearer than `reduce` with a mutable accumulator. |
| Passes `index` and `array` to `keyFn` | Matches the conventions of `Array.prototype.map`/`filter`. |
| Separate `Map` variant | Object keys are coerced to strings, while `Map` supports any key type. |
| Input validation | Fails fast with a clear message instead of an obscure runtime error. |

