```javascript
/**
 * Groups the elements of an array into buckets keyed by a derived value.
 *
 * Iterates over `arr` once, calling `keyFn` on each element to compute a key.
 * Elements that produce the same key are collected (in their original order)
 * into an array stored under that key in the returned object.
