## Usage

```typescript
// Unbounded cache with no expiration
const basic = new Cache<string, string>();
basic.set("greeting", "hello").set("farewell", "bye"); // chainable

// LRU cache capped at 2 entries
const lru = new Cache<string, number>({ maxSize: 2 });
lru.set("a", 1).set("b", 2);
lru.get("a");     // touches "a", so "b" is now least recently used
lru.set("c", 3);  // evicts "b"
lru.has("b");     // false

// Per-entry TTL
