| `set` | `set(key, value, ttlMs?)` | `this` | Stores a value, with an optional expiration in milliseconds. Chainable. |
| `has` | `has(key)` | `boolean` | Returns whether a live (non-expired) entry exists. |
| `delete` | `delete(key)` | `boolean` | Removes an entry. Returns whether something was removed. |

### Usage

```typescript
