 * cannot be retried. Use strings, `Blob`, `FormData`, `URLSearchParams`, or
 * `ArrayBuffer` bodies instead.
 *
 * @param {string | URL | Request} url - The resource to fetch.
 * @param {RequestInit & {
 *   baseDelay?: number,
 *   maxDelay?: number,
