 * @param {boolean} [options.jitter=true] - Randomize each delay (full jitter).
 * @param {Function} [options.retryOn] - Custom predicate overriding the default
 *   retry decision. Receives the response or error; return true to retry.
 * @param {Function} [options.onRetry] - Called before each wait, useful for logging.
 * @param {number} [retries=3] - Maximum number of retries after the first
 *   attempt (so up to `retries + 1` requests in total).
