 * @param {(info: {attempt: number, error?: Error, response?: Response, delay: number}) => void} [options.onRetry]
 *   - Called before each wait, useful for logging.
 * @param {number} [retries=3] - Maximum number of retries after the first
 *   attempt (so up to retries + 1 total requests).
