## Design notes

- **Returns a `Map`, not a plain object** — this allows any value as a key (numbers, objects, `NaN`), preserves insertion order, and avoids prototype-pollution pitfalls like a key of `"__proto__"`.
- **Stable grouping** — items appear in each group in their original order.
- **No mutation** — the input array is untouched; only new arrays are created.
- **O(n) time, O(n) space** — one pass, constant work per item.

