 *   - The response status is >= 400 (treated as a failure)
 *
 * Backoff: waits `baseDelay * 2^attempt` ms before each retry,
 * with ±25% random jitter to avoid "thundering herd" retries.
 *
 * @param {string}    url      - The URL to fetch.
 * @param {Object}    [options] - Standard fetch options (method, headers, body, etc.).
 * @param {number}     [retries=3] - Maximum number of retry attempts after the initial request.
