### Notes on behaviour

| Aspect | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| Time | `O(n)` — one pass, `keyFn` called exactly once per item |
| Space | `O(n)` — every item is stored once |
| Order | Groups follow first-encounter order; items keep their relative order |
| Mutation | Input array is never modified |
| Empty input | Returns `{}` (or an empty `Map`) |
| Key coercion | `groupBy` stringifies keys; `groupByMap` uses `SameValueZero` equality |
| Prototype safety | A `"__proto__"` key becomes a plain own property, not a prototype change |

